# create configuration of your id for git
""" this step tell git who are you by signing your name instead of logging in your account. Later on, when your commit, git will know who do that and document it."""
type code:
git config --global user.name  "your name"
git config --global user.email "your e-mail address"

#check configuration
git config --global list
